WEBVTT

00:05:27.208 --> 00:05:30.000
Here too I can speak
from personal experience.

00:05:31.708 --> 00:05:33.101
When I was young,

00:05:33.125 --> 00:05:37.643
my mother and her generation believed

00:05:37.667 --> 00:05:41.059
that life was determined by fate.

00:05:41.083 --> 00:05:43.083
You couldn't do anything about it.

00:05:44.000 --> 00:05:45.934
My generation

00:05:45.958 --> 00:05:48.684
and the generation of Asians after me,

00:05:48.708 --> 00:05:50.809
believe that we can take charge

00:05:50.833 --> 00:05:52.917
and we can improve our lives.

00:05:53.708 --> 00:05:55.768
And this may explain, for example,

00:05:55.792 --> 00:06:01.726
the spike of entrepreneurship
you see all throughout Asia today.